WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.260
There were so many times that I have actually

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.740
doubted what I have been doing.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.540
Whether you are going to continue that path

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.020
or you're going to course correct

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.380
and take a different path,

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.740
you need to have certain clarity on why this is working,

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.340
why this is not working.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.820
Create a framework of whatever you typically would make

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.100
your decision and like run it by people.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.940
And then you will get that clarity, okay, you know what?

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.260
Maybe I'm jumping into this conclusion too early

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.900
or maybe I have been sitting on it for too late.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.740
Doesn't matter,

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.940
but at least you can actually talk with people

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.980
and get that thing resolved as soon as possible.
